Package: customermodels
Type: Package
Title: Packages, Data and Scripts for the Customer Models Course
Version: 2026.1.0
Authors@R: person("Roelof", "Hars", email = "r.p.hars@rug.nl",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: One-step setup for the Customer Models course. Installing this
    package installs every R package used in the lectures, and loading it
    attaches them. It also ships the course datasets (read with cm_data(), so
    no setwd() is needed) and the lecture scripts (copied with cm_script()).
    The test suite re-estimates every lecture model and compares the results
    with stored reference values, so package updates that change or break
    course results are caught automatically. Note: VGAM must stay first under
    Depends, so that AER::tobit() and lmtest::lrtest() mask VGAM's versions.
